      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(b) notify a person or organisation; or\n\n(c) provide information to a person or organisation;\nin relation to the enforcement or recovery of a fine imposed by the\ncourt, the law applies under subsection (1) in relation to the Federal\nCourt of Australia and the Family Court of Australia in the same\nway as it applies to a court of the State or Territory."
